abstract: "Bilingual station viewer, frozen v15 station-model discharge estimates, and public inference/QC code for strict and retained satellite quality-control policies. Measured discharge, gauge pairing information and observation-level ground errors are excluded. Scientific version 1.1.0; local GitHub release preparation only."
